  "evidence": [
    "Completion leaves the original runtime DRAINING and records exact native/source/target versions, provider IDs, public fingerprint, original freeze and observed-key/completion timestamps. No secret is stored in the mapping.",
    "Only existing hris_worker_capability may execute the fixed SECURITY DEFINER function. PUBLIC/API execution and membership in its restricted NOLOGIN/NOINHERIT/NOBYPASSRLS owner are denied. Fixed search_path, forced RLS and column-only grants are inspected. Ciphertext, native refresh, email and gateway hash SELECT are denied.",
    "Caller must publish group credential/ACTIVE device/SUCCEEDED queue in the same transaction. Function checks current root/account/native, exact frozen target, queue/native proof, original and target generations, matching recent provider-key metadata, binding continuity and zero live slots using actual DB time after guards.",
    "Original device retires before provider/gateway authority clears; exact winning provider IDs, old expiry/rotation/client facts and key publications remain. Changed row counts or late deadline/group loss reject the function. No old job/room guard or provider logout is used.",
    "Actual caller Failed Result, original cancellation/interruption and thread flag after successful retirement roll back both old and new authorities. Identical retry succeeds, including no-original-gateway mapping.",
    "Substituted space/device/native/versions/fingerprint/time never partially retire. A real two-second original lease prevents completion until elapsed. A separately held runtime guard proves fresh DB-time rejection after native access expires while waiting.",
    "Immutable mapping remains account-owned after original native parent purge, cannot be updated/deleted by runtime or owner, and survives actual pg_dump/pg_restore with RLS and schema124 intact.",
    "Full database plus selected domain/storage/native registration/freeze/drain regression passes133 cases and format/architecture. Recovery supports124;15 Python cases preserve existing authenticated envelope purposes while rejecting unknown125."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No application completion repository, admitted retained worker path, public HTTP/gateway or Mobile handover caller is enabled by V124.",
    "Fixture credential envelopes and matching fingerprint/readback timestamps are synthetic for database capability tests. These checks do not prove provider readback, private-key possession, SDK shutdown, remote rollback or a product transfer.",
    "Reuse existing Matrix key repository plus signature/fingerprint policy for actual readback. Next typed port, admitted worker publication/completed replay continuity, then durable Mobile SDK gate/alias/inbox/outbox/read/push handover and cross-company product acceptance.",
    "No live schema rollout or phone APK: live8b40/schema116 pushON/SMTP OFF, normal phone28 and Starter9959c1d remain current. All54 communications groups and actual Apple runtime remain open."
  ]
